C23's conformance files of repr/c (doc/C23-SURVEY.md, CS38 (a), "As built: C3b"; bin/repr-c check --c23).

Origin of the 49 files without a pp_ or lib_ prefix: go-whim, https://github.com/arbace/go-whim at
80c49bf53cd6340487ac623f3d6d135b77ac1db6, crefactor/c23conf/testdata/, copied unchanged; each file's git
blob at that commit, its SHA-256 and its N3220 subclauses are in test/c/corpora.edn (:c23conf :files).
Licensed to Arbace under the EPL-1.0 by their author (CS37 (a), 2026-10-28; LICENSE.md).

The pp_*.c files (and pp_embed.dat) and lib_*.c files are Arbace's own (EPL-1.0), widening the set to the
preprocessor's C23 (#elifdef, #elifndef, #embed and __has_embed, __has_include, __has_c_attribute, #warning,
__VA_OPT__) and to clause 7's C23 additions as musl 1.2.6 and gcc 15.2's freestanding headers have them
(CS32 (a)). Each file's first line names its N3220 subclause.
